OL,3,AFlavio Bolsonaro's passports cancelled
OL,4,Aafter he fails to surrender them
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice in Brazil say they have
OL,7,Fcancelled the passports of the defeated
OL,8,Fright-wing presidential candidate,
OL,9,FFlavio Bolsonaro, after he failed to
OL,10,Fcomply with an order to surrender the
OL,11,Fdocuments.
OL,13,FOn Monday, the Supreme Court ordered
OL,14,FBolsonaro to hand his passports over to
OL,15,Fpolice within 24 hours as part of an
OL,16,Finvestigation into alleged money
OL,17,Flaundering, which he denies.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
