OL,3,AFlavio Bolsonaro's passports cancelled
OL,4,Aafter he fails to surrender them
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt the time, Bolsonaro said he had no
OL,7,Fplans to leave the country, and
OL,8,Finsisted that he would stay in Brazil
OL,9,Fto lead the opposition to his left-wing
OL,10,Frival, President Luiz Inacio Lula da
OL,11,FSilva.
OL,13,FHowever, the deadline has passed
OL,14,Fwithout the senator surrendering the
OL,15,Fpassports, prompting speculation he may
OL,16,Fhave left the country.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
